messages:
emma: Quick note — new hire hit schema.validate failure in sample when sdk's JSON-mode helper returned a JSON string on retry. Short repro below.

emma: Node repro:
```
const r = await sdk.callTool('extract', {text})
// expected: {items: [...]}
// actual on retry: "{\"items\":[...]}" // string
```

noah: I can repro. Root cause: retry path returned raw response body and skipped parseToolResult.

lucy: Short term: add README troubleshooting + guard in sample to coerce JSON strings into objects. Long term: SDK contract should guarantee native types across paths.

noah: Opened PR: https://github.com/redwood-inference/sdk/pull/940 — fixes retry to call parseToolResult and adds unit test simulating auth refresh.

devex-bot: Created issue #1588: "json-mode: normalize structured outputs on retry" and linked PR 940.

emma: Will update onboarding checklist and ping support after merge. Thanks!
